Z||000005||lildevil||09-19-2001||08:37 PM||||It cost me around 3500 dollars.  2500 for the motor ,auto trans, PCM ,axles and all the other goodies.<BR>The rest went to West Coast Fiero for motor mounts and wiring harness.  What was left over went to engine mods and Jet Hot coatings.  DId it my self and was rather easy. A lil problem soloving involved but it was fun and like it was said earlier...a learning experience.  <P>------------------<BR>Earl Sessions<BR>1985 Fiero w/ 1998 Supercharged 3.8 V-6<BR>Best ET: 13.232 @ 101.24 mph<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/water3quarterthumb.jpg"> ||||reg||1
